            "sid": "1SA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na akĩsovelya katevenĩ, kana ĩsilianĩ, kana kĩtevenĩ, kana mbisũnĩ; kyonthe kĩla kĩtonyi kya nyama kyaumasya nĩkyo mũthembi wosaa. Ũũ nĩw’o meekaa ku Silo kwa Aisilaeli onthe ala mookaa kw’o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩĩ, mbee wa matanavĩvya mathunya, mũthũkũmi wa mũthembi nĩwokaa, na akĩmwĩa mũndũ ũla ũnũkũthemba, Nenga nyama ya kũmũvĩvĩsya mũthembi; nũndũ ndekwenda kwaku nyama ila ntheũkye, ĩndĩ nĩ ila mbĩthĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
