          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũndũ waku, ũla ndakaveta kĩthembeonĩ kyakwa, akeethĩwa wa kwananga metho maku, na wa kwĩw’ĩthya ngoo yaku woo; na mosyaanĩo onthe ma nyũmba yaku makakusaa me ma ĩika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũũ ũkeethĩwa wonan’yo kwaku, ũla ũkakĩtĩka kwa ana maku elĩ, Ovini na Vineasi: makakw’a me elĩ mũthenya ũmwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
